#### IV-A1 MLP Network

For train and prediction of 𝑮^\bm{\hat{G}}, 2 dense layers with 128 and 64 neurons are incorporated, along with the output layer of 48 neurons. For 𝒂^\bm{\hat{a}}, 3 dense layers with 32,16, and 8 neurons are used, along with the output layer.

